%% ============ 流程一：注册选身份（P0-1 / P0-2）============
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant R as Register 页
    participant I as IdentitySelector
    participant A as AuthContext.signUp
    participant SB as Supabase Auth
    participant TRG as handle_new_user 触发器
    participant GEN as generate_user_code()
    participant P as profiles 表

    U->>R: 填写邮箱 / 密码 / 昵称
    R->>I: 渲染身份选择卡（顾客/散修/法脉 + 二级细分）
    U->>I: 选 identity_type + identity_subtype
    I-->>R: 回传身份选择
    U->>R: 点击「注册」
    R->>A: signUp(email, pwd, nickname, {identity_type, identity_subtype})
    A->>SB: auth.signUp(options.data = {nickname, identity_type, identity_subtype})
    SB->>TRG: 新用户 INSERT 触发
    TRG->>GEN: 生成唯一 user_code = 'MDG-' + 5位大写字母数字
    GEN-->>TRG: 唯一 user_code（循环直至不冲突）
    TRG->>P: INSERT(guest_id, nickname, role='user', identity_type, identity_subtype, user_code)
    SB-->>A: 注册成功
    A-->>R: 成功提示
    R->>R: 跳转首页（AuthProvider 自动 loadProfile 读新字段）

%% ============ 流程二：点赞每人仅一次（P0-6）============
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户（已登录）
    participant FP as ForumPage
    participant FC as ForumContext.likePost
    participant SB as Supabase
    participant L as forum_post_likes
    participant PO as forum_posts

    U->>FP: 点击点赞
    FP->>FC: likePost(postId)
    FC->>SB: SELECT 1 FROM forum_post_likes WHERE post_id & user_id=auth.uid()
    alt 已点赞
        SB-->>FC: 记录存在
        FC-->>FP: 按钮置为「已赞」并禁用
    else 未点赞
        FC->>SB: rpc add_like(post_id)  [SECURITY DEFINER]
        SB->>L: INSERT(post_id, user_id) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
        alt 插入成功
            SB->>PO: UPDATE forum_posts SET likes = likes + 1
        end
        SB-->>FC: 返回最新 likes 计数
        FC-->>FP: 更新点赞数显示
    end
    Note over U,PO: 游客态（未登录）沿用本地 +1，不落库（维持既有行为）

%% ============ 流程三：兑换 / 阳德提现（P0-10 / 决策4）============
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant EP as ExchangePage
    participant EC as ExchangeContext
    participant SB as Supabase
    participant RPC as redeem_item / create_cashout_order
    participant P as profiles
    participant OL as exchange_orders
    participant RL as reward_ledger

    Note over U,RL: 兑换实物 / 法器 / 清修卡
    U->>EP: 选兑换项 → 确认
    EP->>EC: redeem(itemId)
    EC->>SB: rpc redeem_item(item_id)
    SB->>RPC: 校验 auth.uid() = 订单用户, 读取 item 价格
    RPC->>P: 校验余额 >= cost_amount
    RPC->>P: UPDATE yang_de/points -= amount
    RPC->>RL: INSERT 流水(-amount, balance_after, reason)
    RPC->>OL: INSERT order(kind='redeem', status='fulfilled')
    RPC-->>EC: 成功
    EC-->>EP: 刷新余额 + 订单列表

    Note over U,RL: 阳德提现（现金，≥1000 且为整千）
    U->>EP: 输入金额 → 申请提现
    EP->>EC: requestCashout(amount)
    EC->>SB: rpc create_cashout_order(amount)
    SB->>RPC: 校验 amount%1000=0 且 amount <= 我的阳德
    RPC->>P: UPDATE yang_de -= amount  （提交即锁定）
    RPC->>RL: INSERT 流水(-amount, '阳德提现申请')
    RPC->>OL: INSERT order(kind='cashout', status='pending')
    RPC-->>EC: order_id
    EC-->>EP: 提示「已提交，待管理员审核」

%% ============ 流程四：管理员手动加减阳德/积分（P0-11）============
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as 管理员
    participant RP as RewardPanel
    participant SB as Supabase
    participant RPC as admin_adjust_reward
    participant P as profiles
    participant RL as reward_ledger

    A->>RP: 输入 user_code 搜索 → 定位用户
    A->>RP: 输入 +/- 阳德（或积分）+ 原因
    RP->>SB: rpc admin_adjust_reward(user_id, kind, delta, reason)
    SB->>RPC: guard is_admin()
    RPC->>P: UPDATE yang_de/points += delta
    RPC->>RL: INSERT 流水(delta, balance_after, operator_id)
    RPC-->>RP: 成功
    RP-->>A: 提示 + 流水列表刷新

%% ============ 流程五：按 ID 添加私聊（P0-9）============
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant CV as ChatView（新建会话）
    participant CR as resolve_guest_by_code (RPC)
    participant P as profiles
    participant CC as ChatContext.openConversation
    participant SB as Supabase

    U->>CV: 输入 user_code 或 guest_id
    CV->>CR: rpc resolve_guest_by_code(input)
    CR->>P: SELECT COALESCE(chat_guest_id, guest_id), nickname WHERE user_code = upper(input) OR guest_id = input
    P-->>CR: {guest_id, nickname} 或 空
    alt 找到
        CR-->>CV: peer {guest_id, nickname}
        CV->>CC: openConversation(peer.guest_id, peer.nickname)
        CC->>SB: 打开/创建会话（conversation_id = sort(myId, peerId)）
    else 未找到
        CR-->>CV: 空
        CV-->>U: 「未找到该用户，请检查 ID」
    end
